    <briefdescription>
<para>PDU monitoring node — hardware constants and tunable thresholds (#216). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Hardware constants match the PDU Rev 0.2.0 schematic (<computeroutput>PCB/Base/Power/PDU</computeroutput>, #202): pin map, divider ratios, INA180A2 gain and shunt, NTC bias. Every threshold is a <computeroutput>PDU_*</computeroutput> macro with a default, so a build overrides it with <computeroutput>build_flags = -DPDU_12V_UV_MV=11200</computeroutput> without a code change; the defaults are starting points to be tuned on the bench against the real load.</para>
<para>Units: mV, mA, ms, and tenths of a degree C (<computeroutput>DC</computeroutput>).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="copyright"><para>GPL-2.0-only — see Firmware/LICENSE </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
